@ The scene and the OptiX renderer are plain members. [[m_rendererOk]] stays
false if OptiX could not be initialized, for instance on a machine without a
suitable GPU; the rest of the interface still works, so the program can at
least be used to inspect a stage. [[m_needsRender]] is the one flag through
which every part of the interface says ``something that affects the image has
changed''.

